Package: paraflr
Type: Package
Title: Parallel Firth-Corrected Logistic Regression for Provider Profiling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yubo", "Shao", email = "ybshao@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Kevin", "He", role = "aut"))
Description: Shared-memory parallel Firth bias-reduced logistic regression with
    high-dimensional provider effects (ParaFLR), together with Wald, score, and
    penalised likelihood-ratio tests for a single provider effect. The heavy
    computation is implemented in C++ via RcppArmadillo and parallelised with
    OpenMP.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
SystemRequirements: GNU make, OpenMP
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
